abstract: >-
  EchoHate: hate-speech and offensive-language detection with generative LLM
  teachers and RoBERTa-family mechanism-distilled encoders (var25/rand hard
  selection, toy_prompt 8-way teachers, mech_distill, hybrid LLM replacement).
keywords:
  - hate speech
  - offensive language
  - LLM teacher
  - mechanism distillation
  - RoBERTa
